# Files agents should not read from this repo. wise-writing contains no data, so
# this list is a safety net rather than a rule with anything to catch today.
#
# Research data lives in the project folder the agent scaffolds for the user, never here.

*.rds
*.rda
*.RData
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.sqlite
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.parquet
*.gpkg
*.shp

# Binary document templates — copied verbatim into scaffolded projects, never parsed.
*.docx
